    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <p>Villa guests use the restaurants at the Grand Floridian. There is no separate villas dining room. See the <a href="/resorts/grand-floridian-resort/">Grand Floridian full guide</a> for the current list, including Citricos, Narcoossee's, Grand Floridian Cafe and Gasparilla Island Grill. Hours change; check Disney's official pages before you book. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></p>
