  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Beach Pool</strong> is the main pool, 111,261 gallons, overlooking Seven Seas Lagoon. Official pages describe a 181-foot slide, cascading waterfalls, zero-depth entry and a lounge and bar on site.</li>
      <li><strong>Courtyard Pool</strong> is a quieter zero-entry leisure pool behind the main building, heated, about 5 feet at its deepest, with a whirlpool spa.</li>
    </ul>
